WEBVTT

00:35.770 --> 00:36.510
Nanami.

00:37.310 --> 00:37.850
Nanami.

00:38.650 --> 00:39.950
Haru-chan.

00:39.950 --> 00:40.850
Nanami-san.

00:41.750 --> 00:42.430
My lady.

00:43.270 --> 00:43.980
Nanami.

00:44.550 --> 00:45.230
Haruka.

00:46.020 --> 00:46.650
Kouhai-chan.

00:47.660 --> 00:48.310
Haruka.

00:49.100 --> 00:49.730
Haruka.

00:50.670 --> 00:51.230
Nanami.

00:52.300 --> 00:52.740
Nanami.

00:53.850 --> 00:54.240
Nanami.

00:55.040 --> 00:56.030
Haruka.

00:56.580 --> 00:57.360
Nanami-san.

00:58.060 --> 00:58.740
Ha-chan.

00:59.480 --> 00:59.990
Nanami.

01:00.870 --> 01:01.660
Nanami.

02:48.790 --> 02:54.020
Op.1 Turning Dreams into Music!

02:54.020 --> 02:54.820
Dear Grandmother.

02:55.650 --> 02:57.510
It's already been a month

02:57.510 --> 03:02.710
since the wildly exciting Triple S
Opening Artist entry concert.

03:03.510 --> 03:05.160
Haruka!

03:05.160 --> 03:06.490
Hey!

03:06.490 --> 03:07.870
Tomo-chan.

03:07.870 --> 03:09.150
Good morning.

03:16.320 --> 03:17.590
Nice.

03:18.480 --> 03:20.980
You look super cute when you dress up.

03:20.980 --> 03:22.090
Really?

03:22.090 --> 03:24.900
Tomo-chan, you look more
fashionable than ever.

03:25.450 --> 03:26.470
Well, yeah.

03:28.380 --> 03:29.230
One second.

03:29.620 --> 03:31.190
That should do it.

03:33.300 --> 03:35.560
This day has finally arrived.

03:35.560 --> 03:36.150
Yeah.

03:36.930 --> 03:42.280
It's a very special day for
STARISH and QUARTET NIGHT.

03:42.640 --> 03:46.060
Anyway, the entry concert was amazing.

03:46.810 --> 03:50.040
Just thinking about it
still makes my heart pound.

03:50.040 --> 03:50.910
I know.

03:51.370 --> 03:54.590
I was beyond surprised.

03:54.590 --> 03:56.900
I can't believe HEAVENS
interrupted the concert.

03:56.900 --> 04:00.170
Or that they're actually a seven-man band.

04:00.660 --> 04:01.890
Yeah.

04:07.680 --> 04:11.100
Answer is the "EVOLUTION"

04:11.100 --> 04:14.900
If we look up at dreams alone

04:14.900 --> 04:18.520
We can't become stronger

04:18.520 --> 04:22.240
This price I paid in earnest for you

04:22.240 --> 04:25.990
Surpass revolution

04:25.990 --> 04:29.810
These bonds that turn the world into song

04:29.810 --> 04:33.410
This is an evolution

04:33.740 --> 04:37.580
Evolution forever QUARTET NIGHT

04:38.250 --> 04:40.800
We can fly!

04:40.800 --> 04:44.220
Let's sing (1000%) and dance (2000%)

04:44.220 --> 04:47.470
Scream out your dreams revolutions

04:47.470 --> 04:51.240
Let's kiss (1000%) and hold hands (2000%)

04:51.240 --> 04:52.640
It's for real

04:52.640 --> 04:58.250
The power of love

04:54.670 --> 04:56.480
Full of "love"

04:56.480 --> 04:58.250
We'll hold you tight

04:58.250 --> 05:01.450
A revolution of LOVE

05:01.450 --> 05:04.820
Maji LOVE Revolutions

05:05.900 --> 05:08.680
The moment we change into history

05:07.660 --> 05:10.190
That shines beyond

05:09.580 --> 05:12.580
The sky we cannot see yet

05:12.580 --> 05:16.120
Don't worry (Angels) follow us (Angels)

05:16.480 --> 05:22.880
Let's all go see the
dream-colored HEAVENS GATE

05:20.380 --> 05:22.880
One! Two!! Fly!!!

05:22.880 --> 05:27.190
Let's resonate together (Yes) and
connect together in Heaven (Yes)

05:27.190 --> 05:30.350
The ultimate party is about to begin

05:30.350 --> 05:33.940
Beyond the gate (GO!) beyond eternity (GO!)

05:33.940 --> 05:37.260
The story that God doesn't even know

05:37.260 --> 05:44.650
We'll paint it the color of the HEAVENS

05:44.650 --> 05:46.530
Yes, call HEAVENS

05:46.530 --> 05:48.740
Yes, call HEAVENS

05:52.190 --> 05:55.590
The world will be ruled by HEAVENS!

05:58.120 --> 05:59.920
Nice, nice.

05:59.920 --> 06:02.380
This is an incredibly
interesting development.

06:02.700 --> 06:08.330
But QUARTET NIGHT will be the opening artist.

06:12.840 --> 06:13.790
You're wrong.

06:14.360 --> 06:17.110
The opening artist will be STARISH.

06:17.110 --> 06:18.670
We're confident.

06:19.250 --> 06:22.480
We've worked hard to make
our dream come true.

06:28.420 --> 06:35.650
Who will have the honor of becoming
the Triple S opening artist?

06:57.610 --> 06:59.850
First, we have an announcement.

07:00.570 --> 07:03.950
HEAVENS, who performed HEAVENSGATE,

07:03.950 --> 07:08.990
has not been considered by the judges
because they failed to formally enter.

07:16.650 --> 07:19.370
Quiet. Quiet, please.

07:21.300 --> 07:22.540
That's not fair to HEAVENS!

07:24.010 --> 07:25.750
I will now announce the winner!

07:27.370 --> 07:31.130
The Triple S opening artist is...

07:36.180 --> 07:37.930
QUARTET NIGHT!

07:56.770 --> 07:58.620
Please listen, everyone.

08:00.510 --> 08:05.330
QUARTET NIGHT is declining the opportunity
to become the opening artist.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.250
What? But...

08:12.250 --> 08:14.510
You heard the cheers of the audience.

08:15.260 --> 08:21.180
It's clear that QUARTET NIGHT,
STARISH, and HEAVENS were equals.

08:22.060 --> 08:24.930
It would be rude to our fans if we became

08:24.930 --> 08:28.810
the opening artist under these circumstances.

08:28.810 --> 08:30.400
Um, excuse me...

08:30.400 --> 08:36.990
Let QUARTET NIGHT, STARISH,
and HEAVENS compete again.

08:37.450 --> 08:38.550
Again?

08:38.550 --> 08:39.540
Compete?

08:39.540 --> 08:42.330
Good. So good.

08:43.160 --> 08:45.300
Brother, this turned out
exactly like you said.

08:45.300 --> 08:46.170
Yeah.

08:47.740 --> 08:53.550
They can't ignore us, now that they've
seen our ultra-best performance.

08:53.550 --> 08:56.300
Wait for us, my angels.

08:56.770 --> 08:58.890
We'll pummel them.

08:58.890 --> 09:02.520
Stars, show us the way.

09:02.520 --> 09:03.730
They won again~~

09:02.520 --> 09:03.730
#QUARTETNIGHT

09:03.730 --> 09:04.940
The SSS opening artist should be STARISH! #STARISH
I can't wait
Why can't the three of them perform the opening act together?

09:21.320 --> 09:24.020
I am Isurugi, chairman
of the judging committee.

09:24.020 --> 09:30.250
The committee will examine this matter
and announce the details at a later date.

09:35.660 --> 09:38.080
I can't believe it's already today.

09:38.080 --> 09:39.010
Yeah.

09:39.860 --> 09:43.620
I'm so disappointed I have
to go to work instead!

09:45.000 --> 09:45.990
Thanks for waiting.

09:45.990 --> 09:47.330
Be right there.

09:47.810 --> 09:48.990
I'd better go.

09:48.990 --> 09:50.320
See you later.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.850
Work hard.

09:51.850 --> 09:54.220
Yeah. You, too, Haruka.

09:54.220 --> 09:55.240
I will.

10:01.310 --> 10:03.290
The taxi should be coming soon.

10:22.390 --> 10:26.180
Shall we go to heaven together

10:26.550 --> 10:30.900
It's an ultra special dream

10:30.900 --> 10:35.280
I want to sing the songs of a goddess

10:35.280 --> 10:38.970
The answer is there

10:38.970 --> 10:47.510
With the new beat of H-E-A-V-E-N-S

10:49.310 --> 10:53.000
Thrill me with your music. Good.

10:56.190 --> 10:57.610
Come with us.

10:59.610 --> 11:00.930
Be mine.

11:01.700 --> 11:03.160
I won't let you say no.

11:05.130 --> 11:09.980
In this windy labyrinth, I wish to
become intoxicated by your music.

11:10.990 --> 11:15.980
Nagi will show you an ultra-super
gorgeous dream.

11:18.300 --> 11:20.400
Let's make music together.

11:21.990 --> 11:24.830
I'll take you to heaven.

11:24.830 --> 11:25.370
Excuse me...

11:26.330 --> 11:30.290
Shall we go to heaven together

11:30.290 --> 11:34.880
A new era is beginning

11:35.300 --> 11:39.010
A song to kick everything aside

11:39.010 --> 11:42.550
With a glittering love

11:42.970 --> 11:51.860
Seven souls have descended to this land

11:59.610 --> 12:02.570
It's pure, perfect

12:02.570 --> 12:05.200
We haven't forgotten what's real

12:05.200 --> 12:10.290
The smaller they are, the louder they howl

12:10.290 --> 12:13.040
We won't let anyone copy us

12:13.040 --> 12:16.000
With these voices we'll sing out our love

12:16.000 --> 12:20.960
You dare to sing in the presence of kings?

12:20.960 --> 12:23.930
An endlessly passionate love

12:24.290 --> 12:27.510
I can't lie to my heart anymore.

12:27.510 --> 12:30.600
An impulse to take everything

12:31.520 --> 12:33.520
Unleash your music with me.

12:34.440 --> 12:37.150
The desire to be one

12:37.570 --> 12:40.940
I want to feel our hearts beating together.

12:40.940 --> 12:44.340
Hearts that understand each
other resonate together

12:44.340 --> 12:46.620
Put yourself in my hands.

12:46.620 --> 12:51.830
A Deep KISS of music FOREVER

12:51.830 --> 12:54.560
Let's come together

12:54.560 --> 12:56.950
The world is mine

12:56.950 --> 12:59.430
The world is mine

13:11.850 --> 13:13.230
Nanami!

13:31.580 --> 13:38.290
Let's depart to the starry sky
with rainbows as our bridges

13:38.290 --> 13:45.720
I'll meet you in an airship
that glitters with music

13:45.720 --> 13:49.220
What winds will we meet?

13:49.550 --> 13:52.930
What times will we spend together?

13:52.930 --> 13:56.640
We'll cry and laugh

13:56.640 --> 14:02.040
How far will we go?

14:02.040 --> 14:03.530
Nanami, I love you.

14:04.540 --> 14:05.990
I love your music.

14:07.060 --> 14:11.990
Nanami, I want you to accept
my overflowing feelings.

14:13.130 --> 14:16.190
Haru-chan, you're the only one for me.

14:17.940 --> 14:21.620
Nanami-san, you know how I feel.

14:22.330 --> 14:24.250
My feelings are the same as yours.

14:25.350 --> 14:29.470
My lady, nobody else lights a fire in me anymore.

14:31.100 --> 14:34.840
You know me.  Nanami, I'll never let go.

14:34.840 --> 14:36.930
Not now. Not ever.

14:37.950 --> 14:41.940
Haruka, I want to become
one through your music.

14:43.150 --> 14:49.920
Let's depart to the starry sky
with rainbows as our bridges

14:49.920 --> 14:57.040
With the power of immortal
songs you've never heard before

14:57.440 --> 15:00.790
We don't need common sense

15:00.790 --> 15:04.170
With the highest class of LOVE

15:04.590 --> 15:08.130
Let's fly above and beyond

15:08.130 --> 15:11.470
Let's turn our dreams into music

15:11.940 --> 15:15.100
Turn our dreams into music

15:15.470 --> 15:21.060
Turn our dreams into music

15:54.720 --> 15:56.140
I will now announce the results.

15:56.630 --> 16:01.190
After conferring with the other judges,

16:01.190 --> 16:06.670
we have decided to hold a concert with
QUARTET NIGHT, STARISH, and HEAVENS

16:06.670 --> 16:09.650
to determine the Triple S opening artist.

16:06.670 --> 16:09.650
Decisive Concert

16:08.500 --> 16:09.650
To be held

16:10.490 --> 16:15.670
The concert will be held on
December 24th at the National Arena.

16:15.670 --> 16:18.520
Each group will perform one song.

16:18.520 --> 16:20.580
All the songs must be new.

16:20.580 --> 16:21.750
New songs
New songs!!?
All right!

16:21.750 --> 16:25.920
All New Songs

16:22.060 --> 16:23.920
To ensure a fair contest,

16:23.920 --> 16:29.420
all three songs will be composed by
the Shining Agency's Nanami Haruka.

16:25.920 --> 16:29.420
Composer

16:25.920 --> 16:29.420
Shining Agency

16:25.920 --> 16:29.420
Nanami Haruka

16:29.780 --> 16:30.670
What?

16:33.880 --> 16:36.300
I'm composing all three songs?

16:40.690 --> 16:42.060
Th-That voice...

16:43.620 --> 16:46.020
Surprise.

16:51.320 --> 16:53.280
Miss Nanami!

16:53.280 --> 16:55.950
You are the only composer!

16:55.950 --> 16:56.850
Huh?

16:56.850 --> 16:58.800
We're counting on you!

16:58.800 --> 17:00.430
This is on you!

17:00.850 --> 17:02.250
What?

17:09.090 --> 17:11.420
They're all going to be Nanami-san's songs?

17:11.740 --> 17:12.840
I look forward to it.

17:14.530 --> 17:16.010
This is starting to get interesting.

17:16.010 --> 17:19.460
In any case, this means we'll be
performing at a decisive concert.

17:20.170 --> 17:23.730
STARISH and HEAVENS, I look
forward to working with you.

17:23.730 --> 17:26.440
So do we, Rei-chan.

17:26.440 --> 17:30.230
We didn't come close to your
performance at the entry concert.

17:30.710 --> 17:34.100
We have taken that truth to heart.

17:34.100 --> 17:36.750
But we're working super hard.

17:36.750 --> 17:40.870
That's right. We'll keep working even harder.

17:41.180 --> 17:44.620
And place first in the decisive concert.

17:44.620 --> 17:46.860
What? Don't be ridiculous.

17:46.860 --> 17:50.740
Well, well. You're marvelously confident.

17:51.280 --> 17:55.340
Have you forgotten
that we'll be evolving, too?

17:56.720 --> 17:58.870
Now, now. It's all right.

17:58.870 --> 18:01.970
We'll just be fighting
each other fair and square.

18:01.970 --> 18:04.400
We look forward to it.

18:06.260 --> 18:10.390
Is this the beautiful friendship
between seniors and juniors? Good.

18:10.390 --> 18:13.190
Unfortunately for you, we're going to win.

18:13.190 --> 18:17.450
We'll make you regret declining your chance to be the opening act.

18:17.450 --> 18:18.240
What?

18:18.240 --> 18:19.360
You want to fight?

18:19.360 --> 18:23.950
Okay, okay. Fight with your music.

18:23.950 --> 18:25.200
Got it?

18:34.250 --> 18:35.300
I heard the news.

18:35.760 --> 18:38.300
They say you're composing all three songs.

18:38.300 --> 18:39.150
Yeah.

18:39.150 --> 18:40.430
That's amazing.

18:40.790 --> 18:42.300
It's really amazing.

18:44.760 --> 18:49.350
When I think you're the girl who
became my roommate and friend...

18:50.400 --> 18:53.650
I'm happy for you like it's happening to me.

18:54.910 --> 18:56.070
Thanks.

18:56.070 --> 18:58.680
But it must be hard.

19:00.150 --> 19:03.960
You have to be impartial,
no matter how you feel.

19:05.350 --> 19:09.210
After all, we'd like to
support STARISH, right?

19:10.690 --> 19:14.380
We've been with them forever.

19:15.600 --> 19:18.730
We've worked with them
since we were students.

19:19.180 --> 19:20.880
We made it here together.

19:23.190 --> 19:24.460
You're right.

19:25.260 --> 19:27.230
We've always been together.

19:27.230 --> 19:29.760
There's no way we wouldn't
want to support them.

19:29.760 --> 19:30.590
Yeah.

19:31.480 --> 19:36.070
But I support you above everyone else.

19:36.070 --> 19:38.930
What? Tomo-chan...

19:42.660 --> 19:46.240
Sometimes I actually get scared.

19:46.240 --> 19:47.040
What?

19:47.850 --> 19:52.370
I just love music.

19:52.790 --> 19:56.890
I dreamed about someday writing a song

19:56.890 --> 20:02.680
that captures people's hearts
like HAYATO-sama's music.

20:06.930 --> 20:10.230
I'm so happy that it's come true.

20:11.670 --> 20:12.480
Haruka.

20:13.320 --> 20:17.090
It feels like I've really come a long way...

20:29.290 --> 20:31.290
Nanami is amazing.

20:31.290 --> 20:35.740
Yeah. I can't believe she's
writing three songs on her own.

20:35.740 --> 20:38.170
Haru-chan is fantastic.

20:38.580 --> 20:42.010
She's blessed with talent and dedication.

20:42.010 --> 20:43.050
Yeah.

20:45.160 --> 20:47.690
I'm a little sad, though.

20:47.690 --> 20:48.720
Sad?

20:49.510 --> 20:52.030
It makes me miss the past.

20:52.030 --> 20:57.230
When our little lamb wrote songs only for us.

20:57.230 --> 20:58.580
You're right.

20:59.390 --> 21:03.990
And the seven of us became
a group thanks to Nanami-san.

21:13.940 --> 21:17.380
I'm here because of her, too.

21:17.380 --> 21:19.370
It's already so nostalgic.

21:19.840 --> 21:24.090
We've come quite far since then.

21:28.080 --> 21:31.060
This is no time to be pensive.

21:32.350 --> 21:35.370
For the sake of Nanami-san
who came this far with us,

21:35.940 --> 21:39.520
we must sing her songs
better than anyone else.

21:40.450 --> 21:41.570
You're right.

21:41.570 --> 21:44.780
The battle will be fierce.

21:44.780 --> 21:46.900
But let's do our best.

21:47.450 --> 21:48.360
It's okay.

21:48.760 --> 21:51.660
When we're all together
and have Nanami's music,

21:51.660 --> 21:55.970
we can head towards our dreams, no matter
where they are or how long it takes.

22:23.400 --> 22:25.230
Welcome home.

22:28.610 --> 22:29.830
We're back.

24:06.170 --> 24:08.700
Let's turn this love into a legend together.

24:08.700 --> 24:09.790
Uta Pri!
